COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.tg_articles_publish_guard() IS 'Four-eye rule for articles: publishing or scheduling requires the publisher grant, and the creator of an article may never release it. The only override is the Super Admin grant (app_role ''admin''). The platform Administrator grant (app_role ''administrator'') is NOT an editorial role and must never be added to this check. published_by is derived from auth.uid(), never trusted from the client.';